{"layer_id":"cultural_facilities","name":"さつき公園","category":"public","address":"泉崎字下陣場2-5","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"07464","municipality_pref":"福島県","municipality_name":"泉崎村","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[140.322656,37.154786]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"parks_playgrounds","name":"さつき公園","category":"nature","address":"西白河郡泉崎村","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"07464","municipality_pref":"福島県","municipality_name":"泉崎村","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[140.32047966,37.15660472]}}],"display_comment_original":"泉崎村周辺には、近世村の記憶として関和久村、北平山村、北平山新田村などの旧村名が見える。 この地域には寺社や信仰の場、史跡や遺跡、古墳や貝塚に関わる場所が見え、伊賀館跡、関和久官衙遺跡、関和久上町遺跡のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では史跡説明板、関和久村、北平山村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板が手がかりになりそうだ。さらに田・新田・用水の地名が多く、土地改良碑や用水記念碑が見つかる可能性がある。水辺の暮らしや堤防整備の歴史を示す案内板に加え、治水碑や河川改修の記念碑が狙い目になる。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":[],"notable_people":["石射文五郎","石射猪太郎"],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":["泉崎横穴（国の史跡）","関和久官衙遺跡（国の史跡）","原山古墳","大網本廟跡（如信上人が建立した大網寺跡）","烏峠","泉崎国際サイクルスタジアム（日本で只一つのUCI規定自転車競技場）","マンスフィールド記念館"],"specialties":[],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":[],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B3%89%E5%B4%8E%E6%9D%91","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q66828470","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q7400637","https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E7%9F%B3%E5%B0%84%E6%96%87%E4%BA%94%E9%83%8E&keyword=%E6%B3%89%E5%B4%8E%E6%9D%91"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"泉崎村","wikipedia_revision_id":"107430191","wikidata_qid":"Q1155676","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B3%89%E5%B4%8E%E6%9D%91","japan_search_query_url":"https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E7%9F%B3%E5%B0%84%E6%96%87%E4%BA%94%E9%83%8E&keyword=%E6%B3%89%E5%B4%8E%E6%9D%91","status":"wikipedia_ok"}}